                                "sense_id": "79b3aee5-c3c5-34ce-b99f-746a27bf5f30",
                                "text": "“People never notice you when you are looking half- decent. During the sales I was in a communal changing room and was stripped down to my knicks — and not my best car accident knickers either — when a woman said, ‘Aren’t you that woman off the telly?’ and everyone stared.”"
                            },
