                                "sense_id": "79b3aee5-c3c5-34ce-b99f-746a27bf5f30",
                                "text": "Despite all the attention focused on Beth, when Gossip performs, they are without doubt a band: Nathan and Hannah Billie, the drummer, being just as cartoon charismatic as Beth herself, though perhaps less likely to strip to their knicks and dive-bomb the crowd."
                            }
